  "description": "Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection adapter for TechTeaStudio.Injector. Plugs the Injector container into ASP.NET Core / Generic Host / EF Core via IServiceProvider, IServiceScope, IServiceScopeFactory, IServiceProviderFactory<IContainerBuilder>, IServiceProviderIsService, IServiceProviderIsKeyedService, IKeyedServiceProvider, and an IServiceCollection import helper.",
